> project-plateau-proof-before-dark@0.1.0 test
> node --test test/*.test.js

✔ every core field cue has a concise sound caption (1.630417ms)
✔ audio settings clamp channel volumes and expose caption state (0.16825ms)
✔ cue history and threat transitions stay observable without Web Audio (0.241708ms)
✔ cue history remains bounded during a long field session (0.125958ms)
✔ foundation exposes the locked viewport and performance budgets (1.542417ms)
✔ procedural placement is deterministic for a recorded seed (0.10225ms)
✔ representative scene contains all declared subject and pressure groups (0.08625ms)
✔ the family asset exposes two adults, three young and both authored behaviors (24.532541ms)
✔ the glade composition protects a lit family-and-basalt sightline (13.933542ms)
✔ frame percentile is stable and keeps the slow tail visible (0.155417ms)
✔ runtime sources contain no remote asset or CDN request (5.19425ms)
✔ evidence retention never removes a release-bound resource (52.552292ms)
✔ evidence retention defaults to a non-destructive dry run (50.60125ms)
✔ evidence retention blocks apply when an authoritative root is missing or malformed (104.110292ms)
✔ evidence retention blocks malformed transitive manifests (49.06575ms)
✔ evidence retention rejects symlinks without touching their targets (50.442958ms)
✔ authoritative verification stages recovery outside the authoritative record (49.941834ms)
✔ presentation settings normalize invalid persisted values (1.715166ms)
✔ settings round-trip through versioned storage and can be reset (0.189875ms)
✔ blocked or malformed storage falls back without disabling controls (0.19575ms)
✔ the measured compact route starts with a 180-second light budget (0.975417ms)
✔ fresh and restarted player states are clean copies (0.832792ms)
✔ walking, sprinting and crouching have ordered deterministic speeds (0.52825ms)
✔ pause freezes both world time and movement (0.105834ms)
✔ a solid obstacle blocks penetration and permits axis sliding (0.161709ms)
✔ leaving the navigable world recovers the last stable position (1.225833ms)
✔ zone topology distinguishes the observation fork and both return routes (0.244833ms)
✔ territory, glade, open proof and cover produce four readable threat states (0.491166ms)
✔ examining the brook makes context eligible without awarding evidence (0.140542ms)
✔ successive observed glade plates record young play and branch pull separately (0.217334ms)
✔ camera raise slows movement and shutter commits one physical plate for two live seconds (0.179584ms)
✔ open proof adds two awareness states and contact cracks the best intact plate (0.202208ms)
✔ a later contact without body margin fails while the first contact remains recoverable (0.072459ms)
✔ a timely raised-rifle shot spends one cartridge and interrupts attack (0.145292ms)
✔ pause freezes a raised camera and live shutter commitment without spending a plate (0.063875ms)
✔ restart clears observation, proof, damage and action history (0.068792ms)
✔ intact evidence and all four result thresholds are deterministic (0.09625ms)
✔ covered return commits its deterministic cost once and submits intact proof at Fort (0.192583ms)
✔ an attack-state exposed return cracks the best plate without spending body margin (0.114417ms)
✔ a fired-shot exposed return costs eighteen seconds and preserves its best plate (0.076375ms)
✔ remaining light expires outside Fort with exact cause and actionable cue (0.074125ms)
